From: Camera Firmware Maintainers <firmware@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] rtsp: authenticate session-bearing OPTIONS and test isolation

Keep sessionless OPTIONS discovery public, but require Digest authorization for
both Session and Pipelined-Requests selectors. Pair with the rtsp-server layer
patch that authorizes before session lookup and prevents response-side adoption.

Add real adapter and TLS/SRTP playback regressions for rejected requests,
unsolicited responses, session existence, authenticated OPTIONS and reconnect.

Upstream-Status: Pending

